{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":2684396,"ns":0,"title":"Brush (electric)","extract":"A brush or carbon brush is an electrical contact, often made from specially prepared carbon, which conducts current between stationary and rotating parts (the latter most commonly being a rotating shaft) of an electrical machine. Typical applications include electric motors, alternators and electric generators.","description":"Electrical contact that conducts current","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}